  # ── The rest of the evidenced refusals ──────────────────────────────────
  # The same sweep that produced the nine above found 26 further groups two or
  # more vocabularies define. These are all of them that name a real unit: what
  # is left out below is a CONSTANT rather than a unit (UCUM's [pi]), a value
  # only one publisher states, or a dimensionless "relative permeability" that
  # is a number.
  #
  # WHERE THE PUBLISHERS DISAGREE, the exact definition decides. The CGS-ESU
  # units are built on c, which the 2019 SI fixed, so every one of them is an
  # exact rational and the publishers' 6- and 7-digit decimals are roundings of
  # it -- which is why statΩ is 22468879468420441/25000 here and 898755400000,
  # 898755200000 and 898760000000 in UDUNITS, OM and QUDT. The sidereal hour,
  # minute and second are derived from the sidereal DAY rather than taken from
  # the three slightly inconsistent decimals the publishers state for them.
  #
  # The π-based ones carry .exact = false, as the oersted and the parsec do: a
  # value that is not a rational cannot be converted losslessly, and saying so
  # is the whole point of that flag.
